  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/12/IMG_20211214_132431.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 640px;\" /></p>\n<p>(21 fotos) Ferreter&iacute;a Salvia, en el Raval de Sant Josep, 11 de Onda, te ofrece todo una amplio abanico de posibilidades para regalar en estas fiestas de Navidad. Tambi&eacute;n, todo lo necesario para preparar las mejores mesas para esta fiestas que se avecinan.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaregalsnadal/img_20211214_131430.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211214_131430\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaregalsnadal/img_20211214_131536.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211214_131536\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaregalsnadal/img_20211214_131545.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211214_131545\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaregalsnadal/img_20211214_131552.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211214_131552\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaregalsnadal/img_20211214_131625.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211214_131625\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaregalsnadal/img_20211214_131649.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211214_131649\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaregalsnadal/img_20211214_131816.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211214_131816\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/salviaregalsnadal/img_20211214_131829.jpg\" alt=\"img_20211214_131829\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/s